# Training environment dependencies (input for pip-compile).
# Reuses the production runtime lock so the training environment resolves the
# exact same versions of the shared pipeline libraries (scikit-learn, joblib)
# as serving; parity is verified automatically by
# scripts/check_dependency_parity.py (see ADR-0017). pandas is training-only:
# dtype coercion is ingestion/contract enforcement and never runs inside the
# serialized sklearn Pipeline, keeping the serving environment free of it.
-r requirements.txt
scikit-learn
joblib
pandas
